{"id":"521018a78a163e38","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-rosser-separation.md","title":"Rosser Separation Lemma S","display":"lem-rosser-separation — Rosser Separation Lemma S","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-rosser-separation","aliases":["92-lem-rosser-separation"],"display":"lem-rosser-separation — Rosser Separation Lemma S","source":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–80，Lemma S（PDF 96–97）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]","[[92-df-separation-in-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-rosser-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-rosser-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-rosser-separation — Rosser Separation Lemma S"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 79–80，Lemma S（PDF 96–97）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a769d89316a99993\" href=\"?note=a769d89316a99993\" title=\"92-df-finite-order-system\">92-df-finite-order-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"58d4ef04d6476ad5\" href=\"?note=58d4ef04d6476ad5\" title=\"92-df-enumerability-in-system\">92-df-enumerability-in-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"905868da4e6087cf\" href=\"?note=905868da4e6087cf\" title=\"92-df-separation-in-system\">92-df-separation-in-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F,K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F),\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F),\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=\\forall v_1\\bigl(F\\to\\exists v_2(v_2\\leq v_1\\land\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(K;v_0,v_2))\\bigr)\">\\(H=\\forall v_1\\bigl(F\\to\\exists v_2(v_2\\leq v_1\\land\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(K;v_0,v_2))\\bigr)\\)</span>，辅助变量取无捕获实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 为普通分离关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a769d89316a99993\" href=\"?note=a769d89316a99993\" title=\"92-df-finite-order-system\">92-df-finite-order-system</a>的有限初始段与数码比较性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;B\\setminus A,A\\setminus B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;B\\setminus A,A\\setminus B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in B\\setminus A\">\\(n\\in B\\setminus A\\)</span>，取可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n,k)\">\\(K(n,k)\\)</span>，并由非成员条件及有限初始段证明所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\leq\\bar k\">\\(y\\leq\\bar k\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n,y)\">\\(F(n,y)\\)</span> 都假。由可比较性，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n,y)\">\\(F(n,y)\\)</span> 成立时得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar k\\leq y\">\\(\\bar k\\leq y\\)</span>，从而以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar k\">\\(\\bar k\\)</span> 作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的存在见证；全称化给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(n)\">\\(H(n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in A\\setminus B\">\\(n\\in A\\setminus B\\)</span>，取可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n,k)\">\\(F(n,k)\\)</span>，有限地验证全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\leq\\bar k\">\\(z\\leq\\bar k\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n,z)\">\\(K(n,z)\\)</span> 为假，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(n)\">\\(H(n)\\)</span> 的反例，因此其否定可证。这里无需一致性或有效性。公式的正侧是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\setminus A\">\\(B\\setminus A\\)</span>；把方向写反会错用本书分离引理。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 79–80，Lemma S（PDF 96–97）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-finite-order-system","status":"resolved","id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-enumerability-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"58d4ef04d6476ad5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-separation-in-system","status":"resolved","id":"905868da4e6087cf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-finite-order-system","status":"resolved","id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G$ 是[[92-df-finite-order-system]]的有限初始段与数码比较性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F,K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F),\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)","display":false},{"tex":"H=\\forall v_1\\bigl(F\\to\\exists v_2(v_2\\leq v_1\\land\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(K;v_0,v_2))\\bigr)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}(K,B)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(H;B\\setminus A,A\\setminus B).","display":true},{"tex":"n\\in B\\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"K(n,k)","display":false},{"tex":"y\\leq\\bar k","display":false},{"tex":"F(n,y)","display":false},{"tex":"F(n,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar k\\leq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar k","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"H(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in A\\setminus B","display":false},{"tex":"F(n,k)","display":false},{"tex":"z\\leq\\bar k","display":false},{"tex":"K(n,z)","display":false},{"tex":"H(n)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\setminus A","display":false}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]] → [[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]；[[92-df-finite-order-system]] → [[92-lem-rosser-separation]]给出证明序的分离机制。Rosser 系统需分离 $A\\setminus B$ 与 $B\\setminus A$。"},{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-rosser-separation]]"}],"outgoing":["a769d89316a99993","58d4ef04d6476ad5","905868da4e6087cf"]}